label Greeting
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	KuyaKap: Just passing by to see how the neighborhood is breathing, apo.
	KuyaKap: Looks like things are quiet for now. [pause=0.4] Keep up the good work. People notice when the lights stay on.
else:
	KuyaKap: Hoho! I was just talking to some of the guys at the tricycle stand.
	KuyaKap: They say the new face at the sari-sari store is a good one. [pause=0.5] I told them I already knew that. [pause=0.3] Stay strong, anak.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	KuyaKap: Hoho, caught my breath out there by the breeze. [pause=0.4] Good spot you've got here, apo.
	KuyaKap: I'll head back to my tree now. Don't forget to rest your feet too, anak.
else:
	KuyaKap: Nice watching the street from your shade for a bit. [pause=0.3] Reminds me of the old days.
	KuyaKap: Take care of the store, apo. I'll be around if you need a hand.
[end_timeline]